                <div class="row justify-content-center">
                    <div class="col-md-10 col-lg-8">
                        <div class="about__content animate-on-scroll">
                           <p>I'm Anthony Njoku, an <strong>AI, MLOps, and Backend Engineer</strong> passionate about building intelligent, scalable systems that solve real-world problems.</p>

                           <p>I specialize in <strong>AI and MLOps pipelines</strong>, integrating machine learning models, automation, and scalable deployment systems into production-ready applications. I also work with <strong>Python (FastAPI, Flask)</strong>, <strong>PHP & Laravel</strong>, and <strong>JavaScript (Node.js, Express.js)</strong> — developing high-performance APIs and backend architectures that power modern web and AI-driven platforms.</p>

                           <p>With a strong foundation in <strong>API design, database management, and cloud infrastructure</strong>, I deliver secure, optimized, and maintainable solutions. My AI work includes <strong>predictive modeling, real-time analytics, and automated ML pipelines</strong> for seamless deployment, scaling, and monitoring.</p>

                            
                            <p>Driven by curiosity and innovation, I constantly explore cutting-edge tools in <strong>machine learning, DevOps, and intelligent automation</strong> — transforming data and code into systems that think, learn, and scale.</p>

                            <p>💡 <strong>Let's build the future of intelligent automation together.</strong></p>


                            
